### Actualizar el estado de órdenes de un plan de trabajo — resultado esperado (200)
### orders es un string JSON: arreglo de objetos con orderId, workplanExecutionId y locationId (los 3 son obligatorios para el SP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/updateOrdersStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orders": "[{\"orderId\":1,\"workplanExecutionId\":1,\"locationId\":1},{\"orderId\":2,\"workplanExecutionId\":1,\"locationId\":1}]",
  "orderStatusId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/updateOrdersStatus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orders": "[{\"orderId\":1}]",
  "orderStatusId": 1
}

### Validación: sin orders → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/updateOrdersStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderStatusId": 1
}

### Validación: sin orderStatusId → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/updateOrdersStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orders": "[{\"orderId\":1}]"
}

### Validación: orders vacío → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/updateOrdersStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orders": "",
  "orderStatusId": 1
}

### WD-2050: ejecución de plan inexistente o fuera del scope del partner → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/updateOrdersStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orders": "[{\"orderId\":1,\"workplanExecutionId\":999999999,\"locationId\":1}]",
  "orderStatusId": 1
}
